<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-081" chapter-id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-huanwen-return" source-id="s-jinshu-081-jin098-huanwen-return">
  <p id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-huanwen-return:son" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-huanwen-return:son:m0000" ref="cws_842_o4u">嶽</persName>遣軍伐夜郎，破之，加督寧州，進征虜將軍，遷平南將軍。卒，子<persName id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-huanwen-return:son:m0030" ref="okp_6uz_rfi">遐</persName>嗣。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-huanwen-return:career" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-huanwen-return:career:m0000" ref="okp_6uz_rfi">遐</persName>字<persName id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-huanwen-return:career:m0002" ref="okp_6uz_rfi">應遠</persName>。勇力絕人，氣蓋當時，時人方之<persName id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-huanwen-return:career:m0019" ref="b1r_inb_fts">樊噲</persName>。<persName id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-huanwen-return:career:m0022" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>以為參軍，數從<persName id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-huanwen-return:career:m0031" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>征伐，曆冠軍將軍，數郡太守，號為名將。</p>
</text>
